# BeagleBone — Inference

Three daemons handling camera image ingestion and AI person detection.

## Daemons

| Daemon | Port | Source | Purpose |
|--------|------|--------|---------|
| `inference_daemon` | TCP 9090 | ESP32-CAM (S3) | PIR-triggered JPEG clip receive + TFLite inference + AVI encode |
| `doorbell_daemon` | TCP 9091 | ESP32 Doorbell | Doorbell JPEG receive + TFLite inference + SHM publish |
| `doorbell_stream_daemon` | TCP 9093 | ESP32 Doorbell | Doorbell MJPEG stream receive → ffmpeg → mediamtx RTSP |

## Source Files

| File | Description |
|:-----|:------------|
| `inference_daemon.c` | PIR cam TCP server — clip receive, inference, AVI encode, DB insert |
| `doorbell_daemon.c` | Doorbell TCP server — JPEG receive, inference, SHM publish |
| `doorbell_stream_daemon.c` | Doorbell stream TCP server — MJPEG → ffmpeg → mediamtx |
| `inference_worker.c` | Shared TFLite person detection pipeline |
| `inference_worker.h` | inference_worker API |
| `inference_core.h` | Shared wire protocol constants (JPEG header, length validation) |
| `doorbell_result_shm.h` | POSIX SHM layout — doorbell_daemon → uart_controller handoff |
| `inference.py` | Python inference utility (standalone) |
| `build_info.c` | inference_daemon build timestamp |
| `build_info_doorbell.c` | doorbell_daemon build timestamp |
| `build_info_doorbell_stream.c` | doorbell_stream_daemon build timestamp |

## Wire Protocols

### inference_daemon (port 9090) — PIR security camera
[jpeg_size:4 big-endian][jpeg bytes]  — repeated per frame

connection close = end of clip
Clip duration and frame interval driven by `CAM_CLIP_DURATION_MS` /
`CAM_CLIP_FRAME_MS` on the ESP32-CAM side (default: 10s / 500ms = ~20 frames).

### doorbell_daemon (port 9091) — Doorbell SNAPSHOT mode
[magic:4][version:1][device_id:1][reserved:2][event_id:8][jpeg_size:4][jpeg bytes]
20-byte packed header defined in `esp32-doorbell/main/cam_logic.h`.

### doorbell_stream_daemon (port 9093) — Doorbell STREAM mode
[device_id:1] once on connect, then per frame:

[jpeg_len:4 big-endian][jpeg bytes]

## Dependencies

```bash
# TFLite cross-compiled library required at:
# ~/tflite-build/tensorflow  (headers)
# beaglebone/inference/lib/libtensorflowlite_c.so  (ARM binary)
```

## Build

```bash
export ARCH=arm
export CROSS_COMPILE=arm-linux-gnueabihf-
cd ~/embedded-iot-hub/beaglebone/inference

# Shared inference worker (compile once)
${CROSS_COMPILE}gcc -D_GNU_SOURCE -c app/inference_worker.c -o app/inference_worker.o \
  -I/home/hailviral-server/tflite-build/tensorflow

# PIR inference daemon
${CROSS_COMPILE}gcc -D_GNU_SOURCE \
  app/inference_daemon.c \
  app/inference_worker.o \
  app/build_info.c \
  -o app/inference_daemon \
  -I/home/hailviral-server/tflite-build/tensorflow \
  -L./lib -ltensorflowlite_c -lpthread -lrt -lm -lsqlite3

# Doorbell inference daemon
${CROSS_COMPILE}gcc -D_GNU_SOURCE \
  app/doorbell_daemon.c \
  app/inference_worker.o \
  app/build_info_doorbell.c \
  -o app/doorbell_daemon \
  -I/home/hailviral-server/tflite-build/tensorflow \
  -L./lib -ltensorflowlite_c -lpthread -lrt -lm -lsqlite3

# Doorbell stream daemon
${CROSS_COMPILE}gcc -D_GNU_SOURCE \
  app/doorbell_stream_daemon.c \
  app/build_info_doorbell_stream.c \
  -o app/doorbell_stream_daemon \
  -lpthread
```

## Deploy

```bash
sudo systemctl stop inference doorbell doorbell_stream

scp app/inference_daemon        debian@beaglebone.local:~/inference/inference_daemon
scp app/doorbell_daemon         debian@beaglebone.local:~/inference/doorbell_daemon
scp app/doorbell_stream_daemon  debian@beaglebone.local:~/inference/doorbell_stream_daemon
scp lib/libtensorflowlite_c.so  debian@beaglebone.local:~/inference/lib/

sudo systemctl start inference doorbell doorbell_stream
tail -f /var/log/inference.log
tail -f /var/log/doorbell_daemon.log
```

## Unit Tests

```bash
cd ~/embedded-iot-hub/beaglebone/inference/tests/unit
rm -rf build && mkdir build && cd build
cmake .. && make && ./test_inference
```
